{"id":"doch","lemma":"doch","pos":"adv","rank":50,"glosses":["after all; yet; however; nevertheless","used for emphasis; really; just","indicates proposal; why don't you/we"],"ipa":"/dɔx/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ac/De-doch.ogg/De-doch.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich kenne dich doch kaum.","en":"I hardly even know you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756408","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"kennen"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},null,{"g":"barely, hardly"}]},{"text":"Ich bin doch nicht zu spät, oder?","en":"I'm not too late, am I?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759064","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"late"},{"g":"or"}]},{"text":"Du kannst doch tanzen, oder?","en":"You can dance, can't you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759626","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},null,{"g":"to dance"},{"g":"or"}]},{"text":"Wir sind doch Freunde?","en":"We are friends, aren't we?","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"friends"}]},{"text":"Versucht es doch!","en":"Give it a try.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/167860","words":[{"g":"to try, to attempt","l":"versuchen"},{"g":"it"},null]}]}